    "Control the Agent on this Mac from your iPhone. Tasks run locally here — the phone sends instructions, watches progress, and unlocks sensitive steps." : {
      "comment" : "Remote control",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Control the Agent on this Mac from your iPhone. Tasks run locally here — the phone sends instructions, watches progress, and unlocks sensitive steps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 iPhone 远程对话这台 Mac 上的 Agent。任务仍在本地执行——手机发指令、看进度、解锁敏感步骤。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 iPhone 遠端對話這台 Mac 上的 Agent。任務仍在本地執行——手機發指令、看進度、解鎖敏感步驟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
