    "After a turn that ran three or more tools (or a high-risk one), ask the model to review its own work — did it verify what it claims, did anything fail silently. The critique appears collapsed under the reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a turn that ran three or more tools (or a high-risk one), ask the model to review its own work — did it verify what it claims, did anything fail silently. The critique appears collapsed under the reply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当一轮跑了 3 个以上工具（或含高风险动作）时，让模型回头审查自己的做法：声称的结论是否验证过、有没有失败被吞掉。评语折叠显示在回答下方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當一輪跑了 3 個以上工具（或含高風險動作）時，讓模型回頭審查自己的做法：聲稱的結論是否驗證過、有沒有失敗被吞掉。評語摺疊顯示在回答下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After agent turns, extract durable user preferences and conversation summaries into long-term memory. Inspect and delete anything in the panel's memory view." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After agent turns, extract durable user preferences and conversation summaries into long-term memory. Inspect and delete anything in the panel's memory view."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 回合结束后，把持久用户偏好与会话摘要提炼进长期记忆。可在面板的记忆页查看和删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
