    "Each container isolates cookies and sessions — use separate containers for different accounts on the same site. New container tabs open from the \"+\" button's right-click menu." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each container isolates cookies and sessions — use separate containers for different accounts on the same site. New container tabs open from the \"+\" button's right-click menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个容器拥有独立的 Cookie 和会话——同一网站的不同账号可使用不同容器。新容器标签页可通过标签栏“+”按钮的右键菜单打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個容器擁有獨立的 Cookie 和工作階段——同一網站的不同帳號可使用不同容器。新容器分頁可透過分頁欄「+」按鈕的右鍵選單開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each container isolates cookies and sessions — useful for separate accounts on the same site. Open new container tabs from the + button's right-click menu." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each container isolates cookies and sessions — useful for separate accounts on the same site. Open new container tabs from the + button's right-click menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个容器隔离 Cookie 与会话——适合同一站点的多个账号。从 + 按钮右键菜单打开新的容器标签页。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個容器隔離 Cookie 與工作階段——適合同一網站的多個帳號。從 + 按鈕右鍵選單開啟新的容器標籤頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each profile owns an isolated cookie/session store (work vs personal). Switch a window's profile from its toolbar; new tabs in that window use the profile's data." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each profile owns an isolated cookie/session store (work vs personal). Switch a window's profile from its toolbar; new tabs in that window use the profile's data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个配置档案拥有隔离的 Cookie/会话存储(工作与个人分开)。从窗口工具栏切换配置档案;该窗口的新标签页使用对应档案的数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個配置檔案擁有隔離的 Cookie/工作階段儲存(工作與私人分開)。從視窗工具列切換配置檔案;該視窗的新標籤頁使用對應檔案的資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
